`token_report(*, ledger_path: str, transcript_files: list[str], mode: str = "full", fmt: str = "markdown") -&gt; str`: per-session token report. Reads Claude JSONL transcripts (stdlib json, not jq), aggregates per-bucket usage, calls `report_tokens_cost.token_cost_argv` / `_fallback_cost` for pricing, renders the same HTML-comment-anchored markdown block as `token-report.sh`.

